fxrs is an independent Rust port of the fx coding agent
(https://github.com/vercel-labs/fx, Apache-2.0, Copyright Vercel Labs).

The port is informed by fx's public documentation and repository behavior:
configuration layering, permission modes/rules, the tool set, and session
semantics. It is not a translation of the Zig sources. No fx source code is
included in this repository.
